| `scripts/jobs/export_showcase_static.py --out-dir` | string | `None` | any | `scripts/jobs/export_showcase_static.py` | Output dir = the frontend's static assets (default: the public/ dir of the frontend declared in config/project.json layers.frontend). A relative spelling must resolve inside --root, including every output parent and target; an escape is exit 2 before any mutation. An explicit absolute spelling authorizes that output root. Checks judge paths at call time; a link swapped before the write is not caught. | llms.txt alone: `scripts/jobs/build_llms_txt.py` | when `showcase` is true |
